  "summary": "The code provides a well-structured Azure Blob Storage utility with good separation of concerns, proper streaming uploads via uploadStream(), lease-based concurrency control, and correct authentication patterns. However, it has significant gaps: no RestError handling (missing 409 lease conflict and 404 not-found handling), the listBlobs method collects all results into an array defeating async iteration benefits, BlobGetPropertiesResponse.tags is not a valid property (would cause a build error), and SDK package version minimums are significantly outdated.",
